{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Datablock Lifecycle API.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Datablock Lifecycle API.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender datablock lifecycle api blender datablock lifecycle api","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Datablock Lifecycle API.md","fileName":"Blender Datablock Lifecycle API.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Datablock Lifecycle API","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Library and Kernel Internals]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Library and Kernel Internals","Blender Main Database","Blender BKE API","Blender DNA Kernel Pairing","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Datablock Lifecycle API.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Datablock Lifecycle API.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender datablock lifecycle api blender datablock lifecycle api","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Datablock Lifecycle API.md","fileName":"Blender Datablock Lifecycle API.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Datablock Lifecycle API","heading":"Blender Datablock Lifecycle API","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Blender's kernel APIs give many datablock types a recognizable lifecycle of initialization, allocation, copying, localization, evaluation, and cleanup. A world or camera interface, for example, exposes operations that create the record in a [[Blender Main Database]] and later release or duplicate its owned data.\n\nCentralizing these behaviors in the [[Blender BKE API]] keeps callers from manipulating persistent layouts ad hoc. The pattern follows [[Blender DNA Kernel Pairing]] by placing state definitions in DNA and application-specific behavior in `blenkernel`.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Library and Kernel Internals","Blender Main Database","Blender BKE API","Blender DNA Kernel Pairing","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Datablock Lifecycle API.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Datablock Lifecycle API.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender datablock lifecycle api blender datablock lifecycle api","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Datablock Lifecycle API.md","fileName":"Blender Datablock Lifecycle API.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Datablock Lifecycle API","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Library and Kernel Internals","Blender Main Database","Blender BKE API","Blender DNA Kernel Pairing","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}